      {
        "author_name": "J D",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117346550352296567201/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKEwdugxPDDLe7Q-31sAIuoSCLZGHYVsW65rhGTtrdlb5EZyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Trustworthy and reasonable price, completed multiple projects for me including changing electrical panel, changing outlets throughout the house, installation of pot lights, installing new ceiling light fixtures, running new wires, creating new plug and junction box and removing wires, plug, boxes not to code. Also identified a fire hazard from someone who had done previous work incorrectly and fixed it. Despite encountering some surprises that caused a bit of delay, all work was completed in a reasonable time as promised. Took the time to explain things to me, very honest, many people try to take advantage of single women with little knowledge about the work, if you want someone honest who you can be comfortable with in your home, I highly recommend KVolt! I will be doing more work soon!",
        "time": 1741835468,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liutsiia Kateriushina",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114067455346166887528/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqyk6VzZpaikqdRzPX5NCA3U7cxLKUBgLQBdw0kZCkdRjgPfgygg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently used the services of Kvolt and was very pleased with their work. He installed and connected a generator, and everything was done efficiently and on time.   The electrician was professional, polite, and highly competent. I especially appreciated that he left the work area clean and tidy.\n\nI am very satisfied with the level of service and can confidently recommend Kvolt to anyone in need of a reliable and experienced electrician.\n\nMany thanks for the excellent work!",
        "time": 1717526776,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
